            "message": "Duplication: claim repeats teamGate's holder comparison, add-only assignment, failure handling and contention detection. Changes to claim verification must be maintained in both paths, risking different behavior for explicit and implicit claims. Extract the shared assignment decision while preserving their distinct outcome messages.",
